so that you were no longer burdened (using <D> instead of <d>, so that 
you could drop everything in one turn), and THEN eat the corpse.

I never use <Space> to scroll through messages, for precisely this 
reason.  I use <Enter> instead.  You can safely hold down the <Enter> 
key for as long as you like, and nothing will happen.

I believe there is also an <O>ption you can toggle, which will prevent 
the <Space> bar from duplicating the effect of the <.> key... but I 
prefer using <Enter> anyway.

